                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1defbe7c-626f-3502-9cd1-120e9bccba21",
                        "entry_id": "5e73d048-5ad4-36a2-b966-569ed6b3f15c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "библейск. ветхозаветный патриарх, построивший Ноев ковчег и спасшийся на нём вместе с семьёй и представителями животного мира во время Всемирного потопа"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f23604b0-4bec-4034-a0de-b58eac56fc43",
                                "sense_id": "1defbe7c-626f-3502-9cd1-120e9bccba21",
                                "text": "А когда отступила вода потопная и стала земля сухой, вышел Ной из ковчега и нашел лежащую лозу райскую."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8ddda06b-8554-31c6-a7b4-92a4f2f401a3",
                        "entry_id": "5e73d048-5ad4-36a2-b966-569ed6b3f15c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "религ. 71-я сура Корана"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dbc90a85-0c9f-3fae-acb2-00d3e3155e38",
                        "entry_id": "5e73d048-5ad4-36a2-b966-569ed6b3f15c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "геогр. деревня, в Красноярском крае России"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "35ea2ed5-c6dd-40c7-9521-7deb47fec7f8",
                        "source_entry_id": "5e73d048-5ad4-36a2-b966-569ed6b3f15c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Noah",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Noah",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f33643e-6fa1-334c-b012-8d85f7a77805",
                                        "entry_id": "5c7d6a8a-b267-3055-880f-a0843ac5b8c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A figure in Abrahamic religions, believed to have built an ark to save his family and members of each species of animal from the Great Flood."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d96028d7-0726-4994-aa82-22a60b9cb033",
                                                "sense_id": "6f33643e-6fa1-334c-b012-8d85f7a77805",
                                                "text": "Now, on the night the baby Lord Jesus was born in that stable in Bethlehem, several came to bow down to him and his mother the lady Mary. They were three powerful warlords known as the Magi who brought many fine gifts. And still another, a wonderful man, a sea captain named Noah came to visit Jesus. His ship was called Noah's Ark. The Lord Jesus liked this Noah for he was a wise man, especially in the ways of animals whom he often took sailing in his Ark. This man, Noah was born long before the Lord Jesus but men in those days lived to be very old. So, no one can be sure, no one at all, that Noah did not visit Jesus in that stable in Bethlehem."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "88e4736f-ba22-4e4f-ade8-d31ecb2204e2",
                                                "sense_id": "6f33643e-6fa1-334c-b012-8d85f7a77805",
                                                "text": "But records of the first dynasty, that of the Xia, contain stories of a Great Flood with a Noah-like savior, the Emperor Yu, who gained the mandate of heaven after dredging canals to dispel the floodwaters and make the land safe. Historians have long wondered whether this flood account was a creation-style myth, the folk memory of a real event, or some mixture of the two. Some have dismissed the story of Emperor Yu as a fiction intended to justify centralized rule and, in the absence of any evidence of a massive flood at the time, many have regarded the stories of the Xia dynasty as more myth than history."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf8a79d9-9a78-3981-b399-5db2ae040f67",
                                        "entry_id": "5c7d6a8a-b267-3055-880f-a0843ac5b8c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A male given name from Hebrew."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b59ed708-6ca2-4bc3-8983-b6ac6ae6bb67",
                                                "sense_id": "cf8a79d9-9a78-3981-b399-5db2ae040f67",
                                                "text": "Easy to account for those trends - but what of post-Vietnam America and its generation of little Noahs? Were we expecting a flood momentarily?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3781dd92-b135-4982-8a23-8420f6f0ba8d",
                                                "sense_id": "cf8a79d9-9a78-3981-b399-5db2ae040f67",
                                                "text": "On this week’s episode of “Legion,” Kondracki used her considerable talents to fulfill the promise of creator Noah Hawley’s iconoclastic but inconsistent pilot episode and its subsequent installments. Funnily enough, she did so with another multiminute opening shot."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eacb8f6c-7b3a-3c52-953f-6e4d6b81e4c4",
                                        "entry_id": "5c7d6a8a-b267-3055-880f-a0843ac5b8c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A surname."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
